-- test: a `via` body is not checked for labels, edition 0.2 constructs included (editable bindings under a labeled condition, a map keyed by the value, a loop bounded by it), and a `via` may return a pure function; a function of the trusted module that is not a `via`, even one a `via` calls, is checked as any other (spec/07 §6 rule 6, #384)
-- spec: spec/07 §6
-- expect: error U4001 at src/release.una:28:9
-- expect: error U4001 at src/release.una:36:9
